lc0
------------------------------------------
Lc0 is a UCI-compliant chess engine designed to play chess via neural network,
specifically those of the LeelaChessZero project.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libOpenCL1-2.3.5-1
  libabseil2608.0.0-20260817.0-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  eigen3-3.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libOpenCL-devel-2.3.5-1
  libabseil-devel-20260817.0-1bl2
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LeelaChessZero/lc0

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LeelaChessZero/lc0/archive/refs/tags/v0.32.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack lc0-0.32.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./lc0-0.32.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/lc0-0.32.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lc0-0.32.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(lc0)
  /usr/bin/lc0.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/lc0.README
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/CONTRIBUTING.md
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/FLAGS.md
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/changelog.txt
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/openSUSE_install.md
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/tensorflow.md
  /usr/share/doc/lc0/windows_build.md

